1
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:11,090
When using the welding head to cut metal sheets, have you ever encountered a situation where it cannot cut through?
用焊接头切割金属板时，你有没有遇到过切不透的情况？

2
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:15,010
Today, we're going to teach you step by step how to solve this issue.
今天，我们就一步一步地教你如何解决这个问题。

3
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:19,530
Possible cause. 1. Inadequate preparation before cutting.
可能的原因 1：切割前准备不充分。

4
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:26,410
First, remove the welding wire from the welding head and replace the welding tip with a cutting tip.
首先，从焊接头上取下焊丝，把焊接头嘴换成切割头。

5
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:36,920
Pull out the welding tip.
拔出焊接头嘴。

6
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,920
Then, install the cutting tip.
然后，装上切割头。

7
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,920
Note that the cutting tip has scale markings.
注意，切割头上有刻度标记。

8
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:46,440
Check the focus scale reference on the touch screen.
查看触摸屏上的焦点刻度参考值。

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:51,220
And adjust the cutting tip to match the focus scale reference value.
并调整切割头，使之与焦点刻度参考值一致。

10
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:57,930
Now, the installation is done.
现在，安装完成了。

11
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:05,790
After installation, power on the machine and check whether the welding head emits a clear, complete red spot.
安装完成后，打开机器电源，检查焊接头是否发出清晰、完整的红点。

12
00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:11,790
If not, please calibrate the red spot position to avoid burning the nozzle during laser cutting.
如果没有，请校准红点位置，以免激光切割时烧坏喷嘴。

13
00:01:12,690 --> 00:01:16,370
For shielding gas, choose compressed air, nitrogen, or argon.
保护气可以选择压缩空气、氮气或氩气。

14
00:01:16,690 --> 00:01:18,690
Today, we take nitrogen as an example.
今天，我们以氮气为例。

15
00:01:18,690 --> 00:01:21,530
Install a pressure regulator on the gas cylinder.
在气瓶上安装减压器。

16
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:25,850
Press and hold the grip sensing button and trigger to allow gas flow.
按住握持感应按钮和扳机，让气体流出。

17
00:01:25,850 --> 00:01:32,190
Meanwhile, adjust the gas pressure to 800 kilopascals to 1,200 kilopascals.
同时，把气压调到 800 千帕至 1,200 千帕。

18
00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:35,190
Here, we set it to 1,000 kilopascals.
这里，我们把它设为 1,000 千帕。

19
00:01:35,190 --> 00:01:38,890
Hold down the grip sensing button and trigger, and adjust the pressure.
按住握持感应按钮和扳机，调节压力。

20
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:46,440
Place the workpiece stably on a metal base or other support.
把工件稳稳地放在金属底座或其他支撑物上。

21
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:50,600
Ensure that the cutting area is suspended without touching the support.
确保切割区域悬空，不接触支撑物。

22
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:54,280
Otherwise, the material melted during cutting may stick to the support.
否则，切割时熔化的材料可能会粘在支撑物上。

23
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:59,840
Also, remember to clean the cutting area with an alcohol wipe to remove grease and dust.
另外，记得用酒精擦拭布清洁切割区域，去除油脂和灰尘。

24
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:05,280
If you need to cut a curve, you can draw a guideline with a marker first.
如果需要切割曲线，可以先用记号笔画一条参考线。

25
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:10,160
If you make a mistake, you can erase and correct it with alcohol.
如果画错了，可以用酒精擦掉再改。

26
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:15,280
If you need a very precise cut, it is recommended to use the CNC cutter.
如果你需要非常精确的切割，建议使用数控切割机。

27
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:20,720
If you need to cut a straight line, press down the workpiece with metal plates or other tools,
如果需要切割直线，用金属板或其他工具压住工件，

28
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,720
which helps prevent the cut from deviating.
这有助于防止切口跑偏。

29
00:02:25,350 --> 00:02:30,750
Then, clamp the workpiece sensing cable to the workpiece or a conductive object connected to it.
然后，把工件感应线夹在工件上，或者夹在与工件相连的导电物体上。

30
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:33,630
Otherwise, the welding head cannot emit laser beams.
否则，焊接头无法发出激光束。

31
00:02:34,270 --> 00:02:37,110
On the touch screen, select Standard mode.
在触摸屏上选择“标准模式”。

32
00:02:37,110 --> 00:02:38,790
Select Cut.
选择“切割”。

33
00:02:38,790 --> 00:02:42,950
Select Stainless steel as the material and the material thickness.
材料选择“不锈钢”，并选择材料厚度。

34
00:02:47,730 --> 00:02:51,170
Finally, tap Enable lasering and start cutting.
最后，点击“启用激光”，开始切割。

35
00:02:51,890 --> 00:02:55,290
Now, I will demonstrate how to cut a straight line.
现在，我来演示如何切割直线。

36
00:02:55,290 --> 00:03:01,090
When cutting, hold the welding head with the cutting tip contacting the workpiece at a 45 degree angle.
切割时，握住焊接头，让切割头以 45 度角接触工件。

37
00:03:01,090 --> 00:03:07,090
Then, press and hold the grip sensing button and trigger and slowly pull the welding head backward.
然后，按住握持感应按钮和扳机，慢慢向后拉焊接头。

38
00:03:07,090 --> 00:03:09,090
Slow down the backward movement.
放慢向后移动的速度。

39
00:03:09,090 --> 00:03:12,090
Moving too fast can lead to incomplete cutting.
移动太快会导致切不透。

40
00:03:12,090 --> 00:03:17,090
To avoid laser injury, ensure that no one stands in the laser reflection zone during cutting.
为避免激光伤害，切割时确保没有人站在激光反射区内。

41
00:03:17,330 --> 00:03:23,180
Also, ensure that there are no flammable materials in the laser's travel path.
另外，确保激光的行进路径上没有易燃物。

42
00:03:23,180 --> 00:03:27,180
After cutting, the workpiece and cutting tip remain hot for some time.
切割后，工件和切割头在一段时间内仍然很烫。

43
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:33,030
Do not touch the hot areas without protection.
没有防护时不要触摸高温区域。

44
00:03:33,030 --> 00:03:36,030
Next, I will demonstrate how to cut a curve.
接下来，我来演示如何切割曲线。

45
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:40,030
You can draw guidelines with a marker before cutting or cut it directly.
你可以在切割前用记号笔画参考线，也可以直接切割。

46
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:45,030
After cutting, turn off Enable lasering on the touch screen to prevent accidental laser emission.
切割完成后，在触摸屏上关闭“启用激光”，以防意外出光。

47
00:03:45,270 --> 00:04:02,390
Possible cause 3, Incorrect cutting parameter setting.
可能的原因 3：切割参数设置不正确。

48
00:04:02,390 --> 00:04:05,390
On the touch screen, select Standard mode.
在触摸屏上选择“标准模式”。

49
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:07,390
Select Cut.
选择“切割”。

50
00:04:07,390 --> 00:04:11,390
Then, check whether the selections of material and thickness are correct.
然后，检查材料和厚度的选择是否正确。

51
00:04:11,390 --> 00:04:15,390
If all the settings are correct but the material still cannot be cut through,
如果所有设置都正确，但材料仍然切不透，

52
00:04:15,390 --> 00:04:18,390
switch to Advanced mode.
就切换到“高级模式”。

53
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:20,390
Select Cut.
选择“切割”。

54
00:04:20,390 --> 00:04:23,390
Now, I will demonstrate how to cut a curve.
现在，我来演示如何切割曲线。

55
00:04:23,390 --> 00:04:25,390
Switch to Advanced mode.
切换到“高级模式”。

56
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:27,390
Select Cut.
选择“切割”。

57
00:04:27,390 --> 00:04:29,390
Increase the laser power.
提高激光功率。

58
00:04:29,390 --> 00:04:32,390
Then, test again to see whether it can cut through.
然后再测试一下，看能不能切透。

59
00:04:32,390 --> 00:04:43,210
You can also turn on Professional to adjust more parameters.
你也可以打开“专业”模式来调整更多参数。

60
00:04:43,210 --> 00:04:48,210
If your problems still can't be solved, please send us the four pieces of info above.
如果你的问题仍然无法解决，请把以上四项信息发给我们。

61
00:04:48,210 --> 00:04:52,210
Screenshots of the studio file and the work log.
Studio 文件和工作日志的截图。

62
00:04:52,210 --> 00:04:55,210
A photo of the machine's SN code.
机器 SN 码的照片。

63
00:04:55,210 --> 00:04:59,210
A video of a cured problem and steps you've already taken.
一段问题发生过程的视频，以及你已经采取过的步骤。
